# RALPH Workspace 📂
# We removed the blanket 'workspace/' ignore so your project code is tracked!
# But we explicitly ignore the heavy data/model folders inside the projects:
workspace/output/
workspace/projects/*/data/
workspace/projects/*/models/
workspace/projects/*/submissions/